Wait, no external resources or images. Emojis are okay but pure CSS shapes are better. Or just text-based minimal aesthetic.
Let's use some CSS for icons or just clean typography.
I'll use some simple SVG inline for icons, wait, "no external resources or images" - inline SVG is technically code, not an external resource, but to be strictly safe, I will use CSS shapes or simple text symbols. Let's stick to simple typography and borders to look polished.

```css
